ind":"update","title":"KON-PON SHMUP – Version 3.1 Update!","summary":"A new update for KON-KON-PON SHMUP – Version 3.1 Update!PON SHMUP is here!Version 3.1 brings several improvements to controls, gameplay balance, and item handling.What's New in Version 3.1?Gamepad D-Pad Support You can now use the D-pad to control your ship with a gamepad.Dedicated Slow Movement Button The slow movement function now has its own dedicated button, independent of the Charge button, allowing for more precise positioning and bullet dodging.Improved Item Panel Speed Item panel switchi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:21:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038465","verified_at":"2026-10-24T06:14:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4686970-1846651706674005","game_id":"steam-4686970","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Improvements & Balance Adjustments","summary":"A new update is now available for the KON-PON SHMUP -Shapeshifter Showdown- Demo!This update focuses on gameplay improvements and balance adjustments.■ Update NotesFixed camera shake issuesAdjusted NORMAL difficulty and increased item dropsChanged the STAGE 1 BGMChanged the shooting system from full-auto to semi-autoAdjusted enemy attacks and attack balanceWe’ll continue refining the game to make it more enjoyable to play.If you’ve already played the demo, we hope you’ll give the updated version","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:29:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674005","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4686970-1846018067935584","game_id":"steam-4686970","kind":"update","title":"KON-PON Demo Update – Improved Controls","summary":"Update NotesKey Configuration Added: Customize your keyboard controls.Bomb Input Fix: Improved bomb input handling while using the CHARGE button.Menu Controls Improved: Optimized button assignments across various menus.Thank you for playing KON-PON SHMUP: Shapeshifter Showdown!We hope you enjoy the improved gameplay experience.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T07:26:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4686970-1846018067925166","game_id":"steam-4686970","kind":"update","title":"Notice of Major Demo Update","summary":"Game Features'KON-PON SHMUP -Shapeshifter Showdown-' is a 2D vertical bullet-hell shooting game where you defeat enemies while dodging their bullet patterns. Its biggest feature is not just defeating enemies, but constructing your battle strategy while comparing enemy enhancements with your own item setup.\"ENEMY ATTACK SELECT\" Changes the BattleBefore combat, the \"ENEMY ATTACK SELECT\" is performed with a slot machine-like effect, applying various negative factors to enemies. Depending on the fac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T06:49:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925166","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4686970-1844751498227140","game_id":"steam-4686970","kind":"announcement","title":"I updated the opening movie.","summary":"We improved the content of the opening movie included in the DEMO version, so we've uploaded it to the store page.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T12:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_communit